WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Measuring length

2
00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:09.767
Selam is going to measure her pencil and her exercise book with a ruler.

3
00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:13.400
We always start at zero.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.033
The pencil reaches eight, so it is eight centimetres long.

5
00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:20.667
The exercise book is twenty centimetres, longer than the pencil.

6
00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:24.600
We measure big things like a door in metres.
